repos/main/apt/*/*/payload/
repos/ofpm/*/*/*/payload/
repos/apt/*/*/*/payload/
repos/apt/*/*/pool/
repos/apt/*/*/Packages
repos/apt/*/*/Packages.gz
!repos/main/ofpm/cds/*/payload/
!repos/main/ofpm/cds/*/payload/**
!repos/main/ofpm/node/*/payload/
!repos/main/ofpm/node/*/payload/**
!repos/main/ofpm/pi-agent/*/payload/
!repos/main/ofpm/pi-agent/*/payload/**
